I removed the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause doesn't grant `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, and a component can only import interfaces its node is granted, so the fetch can't ship in this build. The output is unchanged either way, since the enrichment result was discarded. Once the graph definition grants the capability, it can be added back.

